    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91637" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῠρετώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>feverish</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥίγεα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Fract.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			; <i>inflamed</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕλκος</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυρῶδες</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>subject to fever</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύστις</span>
				Id.<i>Aër.</i><i><span class="en">
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of a
				<i>sickly</i> season, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.
			θέρος</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				10
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νότοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					862a17
				</span></i>
			, etc. 
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					49
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
